# sdist payload. The canonical `schemas/` tree must travel in the sdist, otherwise a build performed
# from the sdist (pip's normal path for a source distribution) has no registry to mirror into the
# package and the resulting wheel is not self-sufficient (S4R3-F006). Keep this list minimal: no
# `tools/**` sweep, no round evidence, no dist/ history.
include LICENSE
include NOTICE
recursive-include schemas *.json
